  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of UR-Sweden Program 2013-2018 - Evaluation of UR-Sweden Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering av UR-Sweden Program 2013-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I enlighet med avtalet mellan Sverige och University of Rwanda om st&#xf6;d till &quot;UR-Sweden Programme for Research, Higher Education and Institutional Development&quot;, med insatsnummer 51160027 och 51160059, kommer en programutv&#xe4;rdering att genomf&#xf6;ras under det sista program&#xe5;ret. Halvtidsutv&#xe4;rderingen som var planerad till fj&#xe4;rde kvartalet 2015 har blivit uppskjuten vid ett flertal tillf&#xe4;llen och ambassaden har d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r i samr&#xe5;d med universitetet bed&#xf6;mt att ist&#xe4;llet f&#xf6;r halvtidsutv&#xe4;rderingen tidigarel&#xe4;gga den externa utv&#xe4;rderingen. 
 
Utv&#xe4;rdering av &quot;UR-Sweden Programme for Research, Higher Education and Institutional Advancement&quot; kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras enligt avtalet mellan Sverige och University of Rwanda, p&#xe5; Sidas bekostnad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In accoradance with the Agreement between Sweden and the University of Rwanda on the support to the &quot;UR-Sweden Programme for Research, Higher Education and Institutional Development&quot;, contribution number 51160027 and 51160059, a program evaluation shall be conducted during the last program year. Since the planned mid-term review that was supposed to be conducted in the fourth quarter of 2015 has been postponed several times, the Embassy - in agreement with the University of Rwanda -, has decided to have the external evaluation earlier than originally planned. 

Evaluation of the UR-Sweden Program for Research, Higher Education and Instituional Advancement, in accordance with the Agreement between Sweden and the University of Rwand; Sida will carry the costs.</narrative>
  </description>
